            "margin_top_desktop": "desktop:mt-lg",
            "margin_bottom_desktop": "desktop:mb-0",
            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "1096px",
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/DrBansal-Header.webp",
            "image_desktop": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/DrBansal-Header.webp",
            "caption": "<h3>Breathe easy with Blueair air purifiers:<\/h3><h3><strong>Trusted by Allergist Dr. Bansal<\/strong><\/h3>",
            "caption_style": "p6",
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "text_LD4gGt": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "margin_top_mobile": "mt-lg",
            "margin_bottom_mobile": "mb-md",
            "padding_top_mobile": "pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_mobile": "pb-0",
            "margin_top_desktop": "desktop:mt-lg",
            "margin_bottom_desktop": "desktop:mb-xl",
            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "80ch",
            "richtext": "<p>Breathing in clean air is a cornerstone of a healthy life, especially if allergies or asthma are part of your journey. With air purifiers, the unsung heroes silently working to capture airborne pollutants, you can ensure that the air you and your loved ones breathe is of the highest quality.<\/p><p>Air purifiers do more than just clear the air; they eliminate allergens, dust, and volatile organic compounds (VOCs), transforming your indoor space into a haven of health. Whether you battle allergies or asthma, these devices can significantly slash triggers and foster an environment of comfort.<\/p><p>In this spotlight, we're delving into the effectiveness of two powerhouses: the Blue Pure 411i Max and Blue Pure 311i+ Max air purifiers, backed by the expert endorsement of Dr. Priya Bansal MD - Asthma and Allergy Wellness Center.<\/p>",
            "richtext_style": "s3"
          }
        },
        "image_text_XrfKKW": {
          "type": "image_text",
          "settings": {
            "margin_top_mobile": "mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_mobile": "mb-md",
            "padding_top_mobile": "pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_mobile": "pb-0",
            "margin_top_desktop": "desktop:mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_desktop": "desktop:mb-xl",
            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "180ch",
            "color": "text-blue",
            "title": "Dr. Priya Bansal, MD",
            "title_style": "h3",
            "richtext": "<p>Triple-board-certified allergy, asthma, and immunology specialist at the Asthma and Allergy Wellness Center.<\/p><p>Dr. Priya Bansal pulls back the curtain on why she recommends Blue Pure Max* air purifiers as part of a whole home solution to clear the air.<\/p>",
            "image_mobile": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/DrBansal-Body1.webp",
            "image_desktop": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/DrBansal-Body1.webp",
            "image_placement_mobile": "flex-col",
            "image_placement_desktop": "tabletl:flex-row-reverse"
          }
        },
        "image_text_BK3iUA": {
          "type": "image_text",
          "settings": {
            "margin_top_mobile": "mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_mobile": "mb-md",
            "padding_top_mobile": "pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_mobile": "pb-0",
            "margin_top_desktop": "desktop:mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_desktop": "desktop:mb-xl",
            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "180ch",
            "color": "text-blue",
            "title": "Dr. Priya Bansal, MD",
            "title_style": "h3",
            "richtext": "<p>“Air purifiers remove dust, pollen, pet dander and other pollutants from the air, making it cleaner and healthier to breathe. This is especially important as part of a whole house strategy for people with allergies and\/or asthma, as they can help to reduce the number of triggers that can cause symptoms.<\/p><p>I recommend Blueair air purifiers to my patients because of their strong performance and their commitment to third party testing, which gives me peace of mind that the airborne particles that commonly exacerbate allergy and asthma symptoms are being captured.\"<\/p>",
            "image_mobile": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/DrBansal-Body2.webp",
            "image_desktop": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/DrBansal-Body2.webp",
            "image_placement_mobile": "flex-col",
            "image_placement_desktop": "tabletl:flex-row"
          }
        },
        "text_kxJVYg": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "margin_top_mobile": "mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_mobile": "mb-0",
            "padding_top_mobile": "pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_mobile": "pb-0",
            "margin_top_desktop": "desktop:mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_desktop": "desktop:mb-xl",
            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "80ch",
            "richtext": "<p>Dr. Bansal is a Blueair sponsored partner<br\/>*Dr. Bansal's review pertains to Blue Pure 411i Max and Blue Pure 311i+ Max models<\/p>",
            "richtext_style": "p5"
          }
        }
      },
